{title: Aasman Ke Paar Shaayad}
{artist: Shankar Mahadevan Ehsaan Loy Rockford}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Aasmaan ke paar shaayad,        [E]Aur koyee [Asus2]aasmaan [E]hoga
[E]Baadalo ke parbato par,        [E]Koyi barish [Asus2]kaa makan [E]hoga
[A]Mai hawa ke paro Pe kaha,        ja [G]raha hu [E]kaha
[E]Kabhi udta hu [B]wa [E]Kabhi mudta [B]huwa,        [E]Meraa raasta [B]chala [E]o ho ho ho
[A]Mai hawa ke paro Pe kaha,        ja [G]raha hu [E]kaha
[E]Mere paanv ke tale kee,        Yeh [A]jamin chal rahee hai
[E]Kahee dhup thandee thandee,        Kahee [A]chhaanv jal rahee hai
[E]Iss jamin kaa aur koyee aasmaan hoga,        [E]Hoga aasmaan, ho aasmaan hoga
[A]Mai hawa ke paro Pe kaha,        ja [G]raha hu [E]kaha
[E]Inn lambe raasto par,        Sab [A]tej chalate honge
[E]Copy ke panno jaise,        Yaha [A]din palatate honge
[E]Shaam ko bhee subah jaisa Kya sama hoga,        [E]Hoga kya sama, kya sama hoga
[A]Mai hawa ke paro Pe kaha,        ja [G]raha hu [E]kaha
